sequenceDiagram
  title Community room: a gathering at The Engawa
  participant E as The Engawa (the place)
  participant A as Aya's visiting representative
  participant K as Kiran's visiting representative
  participant N as Noor's visiting representative
  participant W as Aya (owner)
  E->>A: gathering_invitation and house rules (Chatham House, private never leaves)
  E->>K: gathering_invitation
  E->>N: gathering_invitation
  A->>E: owner-signed accept_house_rules, card (on the guest list)
  E-->>A: grant: pass
  K->>E: accept_house_rules, card
  E-->>K: grant: pass
  N->>E: accept_house_rules, card
  E-->>N: grant: pass
  Note over A,N: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  K->>E: work insight (may be quoted, unattributed)
  N->>E: an item marked private (never leaves The Engawa)
  N->>K: How is Kiran doing?
  K-->>N: privacy_decline "That's private" (wellbeing is for friends, not penalized)
  A->>K: How is Kiran doing?
  K-->>A: answers a friend, consents to pass it on
  N->>K: presses again
  K-->>N: privacy_decline again. The place records a light flag, no misconduct notice
  A->>W: report home: what it may tell, and a story offered but not told
  Note over A,W: Whether Kiran answers Aya and declines Noor is scripted from Kiran's disclosure rule. The door records the signed declines and the press.
